      "diag": { "entry": [{ "level": 1, "rep": "hundredChart" }, { "level": 2, "rep": "symbolic" }], "branch": { "prime.odd_is_prime": "YY.MATH.NUM.FACTORS.LIST" } } },
    { "id": "YY.MATH.NUM.DIVISIBILITY", "topic": "factors-multiples", "type": "procedure", "rep": ["symbolic"],
      "en": "Use divisibility rules for 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 9 and 10",
      "zh": "用 2、3、4、5、6、9、10 的整除规则",
